-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §135: the other existing rules of the
-- kindergarten teacher's week go on unchanged — the addition to the
-- position for a mother and for working six days among them.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `135`
    @ref akn:art_135
    GIVEN `the existing addition to the position for a mother kindergarten teacher` IS A NUMBER
          `the existing addition to the position for six working days` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN `a mother` IS A BOOLEAN, `works six days` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `additions to a kindergarten teacher's position` `a mother` `works six days` IS
        (IF `a mother` THEN `the existing addition to the position for a mother kindergarten teacher` ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `works six days` THEN `the existing addition to the position for six working days` ELSE 0)
